.\n\nMiddle Right (材质特写 - Material Textures): Multiple square close-up panels zooming in on various textures, labeled in Chinese (e.g., \"头发发丝\", \"制服布料纹理\", \"蛋糕奶油细节\", \"袜子针织面料\", \"皮鞋光泽\", \"蛋糕截面\").\n\nBottom Section (随身物品 - Inventory): An overflowing open bag with a large collection of personal belongings and items relevant to the character's context spilling out, all individually labeled with Chinese annotations (e.g., \"智能手机(带挂件)\", \"便携游戏机\", \"学生证\", \"多色笔袋\", \"发圈/发卡\", \"手帕/纸巾\", \"德国小零食/巧克力\", \"笔记本\", \"小镜子\", \"口红\", \"耳机\").\n\nBottom Right (私密物品/其他 - Private Items/Extras): A small section with personal items like photographs or mementos, labeled in Chinese (e.g., \"合照/照片\", \"纪念章/挂件\").", null, null, null, null, null, null], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 12, "type": "DapaoPromptNode", "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "DapaoPromptNode"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#c09430", "widgets_values": ["## 从下面地址注册一个API令牌，复制到上面紫色节点内\n## 👉[大炮API节点地址（一键直达）](https://github.com/paolaoshi/ComfyUI-dapaoAPI)👈\n\n-------------------\n## 🎿注册地址：👉[火山API申请 注意要开通对应的模型权限](https://console.volcengine.com/ark/region:ark+cn-beijing/apiKey?apikey=%7B%7D)👈"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)", "size": [483.2469482421875, 189.06222534179688], "pos": [2296.830810546875, -1030.17822265625], "id": 8, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [9], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [423.03515625, 671.50018310546